// Trie: a prefix tree of strings.
//
// Stores strings by their characters, one tree level per character, so all strings sharing a prefix
// share a path. Finding every stored string that starts with a prefix takes time proportional to
// the prefix. Useful for autocomplete, spell checking, routing tables, and keyword matching.
//
